{"id": "EUVD-2026-63086", "enisaUuid": "9d220ebb-7d8f-3584-bf73-e3d4dc405186", "description": "A flaw was found in mce-operator-bundle. The build process fetches and executes scripts from a remote repository without performing integrity checks, such as commit pinning or signature verification. This allows a malicious actor with write access to the remote repository to inject and execute arbitrary code during the build. The consequence is a compromised build process, potentially leading to the distribution of malicious software.", "datePublished": "2026-08-19T20:47:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-29T19:41:48", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:H/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:59634", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:59636", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:59637", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:59638", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:59642", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:59643", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-75569", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2519849"], "aliases": ["GHSA-77qj-pc4h-hxwh", "CVE-2026-75569"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.6, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "18ccd95a-eb08-335b-984c-4e6f3bc86b63", "product": {"name": "multicluster engine for Kubernetes 2.6", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1787317415"}, {"id": "401a72b6-344f-3dce-bedb-320e07750525", "product": {"name": "multicluster engine for Kubernetes 2.11", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1787321579"}, {"id": "93d9c30a-422c-360f-b719-ebd07203ef1a", "product": {"name": "multicluster engine for Kubernetes 2.10", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1787263075"}, {"id": "a7fd165c-322e-3041-a1c2-5434d7f240f5", "product": {"name": "multicluster engine for Kubernetes 2.8", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1787318262